/* fui: Qt, edition aurora, applied to every Qt6 app through qt6ct. (No double slashes in this file: qt6ct strips them as comments.) */
QWidget { background-color: #0b0916; color: #ede9f8; selection-background-color: #a47cff; selection-color: #0b0716; }
